    {
      "source": "hackernews",
      "subsource": "news.ycombinator.com",
      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Anthropic's proposed AI safety bill only kicks in if 50 deaths or $1B in damages",
      "url": "https://www.tomshardware.com/tech-industry/artificial-intelligence/anthropics-proposed-ai-safety-bill-only-kicks-in-if-50-deaths-or-usd1-billion-in-damages-are-on-the-line-proposal-would-effectively-make-the-commerce-department-the-only-agency-capable-of-stopping-an-ai-model",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50141429",
      "score": 144,
      "comments": 156,
      "author": "f-serif",
      "published": "2026-10-18T14:30:27Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic's policy proposal sets high statutory thresholds, shielding frontier AI developers from legal liability until catastrophic harm occurs.",
        "The 50-death and $1B loss triggers exclude routine harms like targeted cyberattacks, deepfakes, and automated IP theft from major penalties.",
        "Safety auditing and compliance obligations will prioritize preventing critical infrastructure collapse and CBRN weaponization over daily deployment risks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/programming",
      "category": "engineering",
      "title": "Algorithmic Sound Design with L-Systems and Granular Synthesis",
      "url": "https://nathanho.me/posts/evograin/",
      "discuss_url": "https://lobste.rs/s/kiq0si",
      "score": 8,
      "comments": 0,
      "author": "chrisl",
      "published": "2026-10-18T12:06:05Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Recursive Lindenmayer string-rewriting grammars drive macro-structural composition and trigger schedules for procedural micro-sound generation.",
        "Parsed grammar symbols map directly into granular DSP parameters, dynamically modulating grain duration, buffer playback position, and pitch transposition.",
        "Coupling deterministic formal languages with audio micro-sampling generates complex, self-similar, evolving acoustic textures without high sample storage overhead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/security",
      "category": "security",
      "title": "It's time to talk about TEEs",
      "url": "https://alinush.github.io//tee",
      "discuss_url": "https://lobste.rs/s/edli0x",
      "score": 8,
      "comments": 2,
      "author": "zk",
      "published": "2026-10-18T03:00:39Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Hardware isolation primitives like AMD SEV, Intel SGX, and AWS Nitro Enclaves increasingly protect sensitive runtime data from untrusted cloud hosts.",
        "TEEs remain vulnerable to microarchitectural side-channel attacks, speculative execution flaws, and memory safety bugs within enclave software stacks.",
        "Remote attestation cryptographically verifies enclave integrity, but introduces strict dependencies on vendor root keys and complex measurement validation pipelines."
      ]
    },
