      "bullets": [
        "Free-tier traffic delivers massive attack telemetry, training automated DDoS mitigation systems and WAF rule engines across Cloudflare's global edge network.",
        "Aggregating millions of free domains maximizes edge scale, granting Cloudflare leverage to secure settlement-free peering and slash bandwidth transit costs.",
        "Serving free static caching absorbs surplus off-peak capacity, turning idle network infrastructure into a self-funding enterprise sales and intelligence pipeline."
      ]
